        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Taylor Swift, Shellback, Adam Levine, Benny Blanco, Karl Johan Schuster\n- Products: 1989, Red, Animals\n- Roles: songwriter, record producer, musician\n\nFacts:\n- Taylor Swift began composing the album 1989 after releasing her previous studio album Red in 2012.\n- Karl Johan Schuster was born on 1 February 1985 and is professionally known as Shellback.\n- Shellback is a Swedish songwriter, record producer, and musician.\n- The Maroon 5 song Animals was written by Adam Levine, Benny Blanco, and Shellback.\n- Shellback also produced the song Animals.",
